# devlog/PUBLISH — the public DevLog's publish ledger.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
#   The Cloudflare Pages project `axiomancer-devlog` builds ONLY when this
#   file changes (its build watch paths include nothing else — see
#   docs/devlog-public-deploy.md, step 7). A push that does not touch it
#   never deploys, so the public site moves on player-visible news, not on
#   every loop commit.
#
# WHO WRITES IT
#   /digest appends ONE line when that night's entry carries a
#   player-visible change (skills/digest.md §3 step 5b — the publish gate).
#   A person may append a `manual:` line to force a deploy, e.g. after a
#   fix to the site's own build scripts.
#
# RULES
#   - Append-only. Never edit or delete a past line; git history is the
#     record of every publish.
#   - One line per publish: `<YYYY-MM-DD> — <the entry's title>` or
#     `<YYYY-MM-DD> — manual: <reason>`.
#   - Nothing between publishes is lost: the build renders every entry in
#     devlog/entries/, so a skipped night appears with the next publish.

